1
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:05,610
前院里怎么有那么多巨型棒棒糖啊
Why there are giant lolipops all over the front yard?

2
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,120
怎么味道那么怪呢
And why they taste so bad?

3
00:00:07,131 --> 00:00:09,380
因为是硬纸板做的 蠢蛋
Because they are made of cardboard, mouth breather.

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,840
世界需要梦想家 卢克
Hey, the world needs more dreamers, Luke

5
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,560
舔舐不息 梦想不止
Never stop licking things.

6
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,700
我知道很挫
I know it's lame,

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,420
可是去年答应了邻居们
but after last year we promised the neighbours

8
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:19,140
我们会把装饰弄得和谐一点
we would keep our decorations more family friendly.

9
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:20,500
我们连刻个南瓜都不行吗
We can't carve a pumpkin?

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,980
他们的请愿书写得十分有针对性
The petition was very specific.

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,020
每次万圣节 我们家装扮得最恐怖
Every Halloween, we have the best house.

12
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,680
去年 我的水平更上一层楼
Last year, I took things to a whole new level.

13
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,625
但显然对于某些孩子来说太恐怖了
But appearently it's too scary for some kids.

14
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,100
外加一个大人
And one adult.

15
00:00:33,984 --> 00:00:35,600
不给糖就捣蛋
Trick-or-treat!

16
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,420
你们想要点糖吃吗
Would you like some candy?

17
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:38,520
是的
Yeah!

18
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:41,460
还是更想要这个呢
Or would you rather have this?

19
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,840
别装了 才吓不着你呢
Come on. You're fine.

20
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,440
我才不管别人说什么
I don't care what anyone says.

21
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:59,080
反正不是你害的那人心脏病发作
You did not give that man a heart attack.

22
00:00:59,080 --> 00:00:59,940
谢谢
Thank you.

23
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:01,240
你根本就不吓人
I mean, you're not even scary.

24
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:03,340
我能抓点糖吗
Can I grab a little bit of this candy

25
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,300
给今晚看房的客户们吃
for my open house tonight?

26
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:05,680
可以 当然 可是
Uh, yeah, sure, but...

27
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:08,440
太有才了 在万圣节办开放参观
It's genius. An open house on Halloween.

28
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,940
当爹妈的无聊透了
Millions of bored parents,

29
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:13,480
平常忙着照看孩子 不出车祸
just trying to keep their... kids out of traffic.

30
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:14,820
现在他们可以脱身啦
Now they can get away from all that,

31
00:01:14,820 --> 00:01:16,420
去参观一座好房子
And see a nice house.

32
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:18,340
什么叫我根本就不吓人啊
What do you mean, I'm not even scary?

33
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:21,600
我差点吓出一条人命来
I literally almost scared the life out of a man.

34
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:23,680
你就是把人家吓出了点白沫
You literally scared a little saliva

35
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,980
吓出了点尿
And a little urine out of him.

36
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:27,540
我每次看到猴子穿着人的衣服闹腾就这样
That happens to me every time I see a monkey wearing people clothes.

37
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:28,920
我相当吓人
I was plenty scary.

38
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,840
我的妆容可是专业等级的
I used professional-grade makeup.

39
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:33,280
说到点子上了 克莱尔 你太过了
That's the point, Claire. It was overkill.

40
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,560
你是那种
You're the kind of person

41
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:37,360
不化妆才吓死人的女人 再见
who can be twice as scary without wearing any makeup. Bye.

42
00:01:51,641 --> 00:01:53,240
你记得去把装扮服取回来了 是吧
You remembered to pick up the costumes, right?

43
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,120
对的 放在那儿了
Yes, they're right over there.

44
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:54,880
太激动人心了
Very excited.

45
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,820
小卡减了不少肥
Cam has lost a lot of weight--

46
00:01:56,820 --> 00:01:57,380
打住
No.

47
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:59,360
所以我们打算开个万圣节派对
So we're throwing a Halloween party

48
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,580
让全新的小卡粉墨登场
to debut the new him.

49
00:02:00,660 --> 00:02:01,980
我将扮成斗牛士
I'll be dressed as a matador.

50
00:02:02,612 --> 00:02:03,986
现在减了多少磅 30吗
Wh-what is it now, 30?

51
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:07,480
相当于我减掉了莉莉的重量[丢了]
So I've lost Lily.

52
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:09,960
莉莉去哪儿了
Where is lily?

53
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,526
-你 她没有跟你一起吗 -没
- Do you--you don't have her? - No.

54
00:02:11,526 --> 00:02:12,467
她怎么会跟我在一起呢
Why would I have her?

55
00:02:12,467 --> 00:02:14,080
-我又没把她装在口袋里 -小卡
- I don't have her in my pocket. - Cam?

56
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,080
皇冠头饰呢
What about the tiara?

57
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,226
我们没买
Uh, we didn't buy one.

58
00:02:16,226 --> 00:02:18,080
你可以戴去年的
You can just use the one from last year.

59
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,180
我们变穷了吗
Are we poor?

60
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:22,000
不是 甜心 你用不着两个皇冠头饰啊
No, sweetheart, but you don't need two tiaras.

61
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:24,600
明年万圣节你换套服装怎么样啊
How about next Halloween you try a different costume?

62
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:26,700
不行 我必须扮公主
No. I have to be a princess.

63
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:28,080
每年都要吗 为什么
Every year? Why?

64
00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:30,000
因为我妈妈是个公主
Because my mom's a princess,

65
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,800
你告诉我的
Just like you told me.

66
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,060
我和小卡都知道早晚有一天
Cam and I have always known that someday,

67
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:37,260
我们得和莉莉谈谈
we were gonna have to have the big talk with lily,

68
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:39,000
她妈妈的事
about who her mom was.

69
00:02:39,514 --> 00:02:41,900
我 我们会找准时机
We--we were gonna pick the right time

70
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:43,420
一起跟她谈
and do it together,

71
00:02:43,420 --> 00:02:45,915
严格按我们商量好的剧本上演
Carefully following an agreed-upon script.

72
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,820
然后有一天我累了
Then I got tired.

73
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:52,780
"她是人间天堂魔幻三界最漂亮的公主
"And she was the most beautiful princess in all the land.

74
00:02:52,780 --> 00:02:54,620
剧终"
The end."

75
00:02:55,180 --> 00:02:55,900
多少遍了啊
Again.

76
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:59,600
为什么泰勒的妈妈那么肥
Why is Tyler's mommy so fat?

77
00:03:00,672 --> 00:03:04,080
那是因为她 她怀着个小宝宝
Oh, that's because she has-- she has a baby in her belly.

78
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,000
行了吧 晚安
Okay? Good night.

79
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:08,340
我妈妈也怀过我吗
Was I in my mom's belly?

80
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,580
莉莉 不许再问了 好吧
Lily, no more questions, all right?

81
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:11,884
快 快睡觉
Just--just go to sleep.

82
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:14,120
我妈妈现在在哪儿
Where's my mom now?

83
00:03:14,431 --> 00:03:16,077
她在
Um, she's...

84
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,400
在遥远的国度
in a faraway land.

85
00:03:19,300 --> 00:03:20,020
为什么
Why?

86
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:23,120
因为她是个公主
Because she's a princess.

87
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:26,040
并且她 很忙很忙
And she's... very, very busy.

88
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:28,380
好吧
Okay.

89
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:31,400
我以为她第二天早晨就忘了呢
I thought that she'd forget about it by the next morning.

90
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:32,580
反正我是忘了
I mean, I did.

91
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:35,140
我知道终究是要告诉小卡的
Oh, I knew I was gonna have to tell Cam,

92
00:03:35,149 --> 00:03:36,340
他知道了肯定会很生气
and he was gonna be furious,

93
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:38,300
但我希望他能意识到更严重的问题
but I was hoping that he'd see the bigger issue.

94
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:41,020
我当时真的累惨了
You know, I was really tired.

95
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:45,100
小卡 你知道莉莉
Hey, Cam, you know this whole thing

96
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:46,840
今年又想打扮成公主吗
about Lily wanting to be a princess again?

97
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:48,980
我想 那可能是因为我让她相信
Well, I-I think it might be because I let her believe

98
00:03:48,980 --> 00:03:51,160
-她妈妈是 -真是场噩梦
- her mother was-- - This is a nightmare.

99
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:53,880
-只是犯了点小错 -简直是灾难啊
- It was just a mistake. - More like a disaster.

100
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:57,020
他们送来的斗牛士服是按你的尺寸做的
They sent the matador costume in your size,

101
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:59,400
而公牛服按我的尺寸做的
and the bull costume in mine.

102
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,771
我没注意到
Oh. I didn't notice. Um...

103
00:04:00,771 --> 00:04:02,340
穿着这件肥大的公牛服
Now no one's gonna see my bod

104
00:04:02,340 --> 00:04:04,200
别人看不到人家的好身材了啦
in this bulky bull costume.

105
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:06,139
这个 真的是无心之过啦
It was--it was honestly a mistake.

106
00:04:06,139 --> 00:04:08,700
听着 你也可以尝试你以前想试的造型
L-listen, um, you--you could do that other thing that you thought of.

107
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:10,260
你现在也可以穿那套
You could put on that gorgeous white suit

108
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:12,000
超美超合身的白色西服
that fits you so well now,

109
00:04:12,219 --> 00:04:13,580
然后扮演洛克先生
and you could be Mr. Roarke,

110
00:04:13,580 --> 00:04:14,800
让莉莉扮你的"小纹身"
and Lily could be your Tattoo.

111
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:17,120
不行 人家就要当公主
No! I have to be a princess!

112
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,020
但是莉莉 你去年就扮过公主了呀
Oh, but, Lily, you were a princess last year.

113
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:21,760
不行 你答应过我的 我就要当公主
No! You promised! I'm being a princess!

114
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:25,500
她为什么这么痴迷于公主
Why is she so obsessed with princesses?

115
00:04:25,538 --> 00:04:26,735
怎么说呢
Well...

116
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,540
我们小时候也成天想当公主啊
Like we weren't at that age?

117
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,280
我是说
I mean...

118
00:04:32,900 --> 00:04:34,480
我不是因为这罚单生气
I'm not mad about the ticket.

119
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:36,380
只是这是我第一次没能成功地
It's just the first time I couldn't charm my way

120
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:37,240
利用个人魅力免于处罚
Out of one of these things.

121
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,040
在我看来 这不是罚单问题
The way I see it, it's not a ticket.

122
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,660
而是社交问题
It's a conversation.

123
00:04:41,540 --> 00:04:43,080
无意冒犯 但你根本不需要警笛
No offense. You don't need that siren.

124
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:45,340
你一下警车 别人就都停下来盯着看了
You could stop traffic just getting out of that squad car.

125
00:04:45,340 --> 00:04:47,280
请给我你的驾照和车辆注册证
License and registration, please.

126
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:49,900
我
I, uh...

127
00:04:49,900 --> 00:04:52,340
我对警察学校挺熟的
I'm no stranger to the police academy myself.

128
00:04:52,580 --> 00:04:53,360
我看过全7部电影
Seen all seven of them.

129
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:54,960
先生 没人看过7部全辑
Sir, no one's seen all seven.

130
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,180
-上面的个人信息都准确吗 -是的
- Is this information accurate? - Yeah.

131
00:04:57,204 --> 00:04:59,180
除了体重
Uh, except for the weight.

132
00:04:59,180 --> 00:05:01,260
我以为他们是想知道我能举多重的东西
I thought they wanted to know how much I could curl.

133
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:04,640
我的技能日渐生疏了啊
I must be getting rusty with my moves.

134
00:05:04,960 --> 00:05:05,960
技能 什么技能
Moves? What moves?

135
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:07,620
闪动我浅蓝色的媚眼
You know, flash the baby blues,

136
00:05:07,620 --> 00:05:09,388
用奸笑迷惑她
hit 'em with the devilish grin.

137
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:10,820
紧急情况下 砸破车窗
In case of emergency, break glass

138
00:05:10,820 --> 00:05:11,820
露出我迷人的酒窝
and bust out the dimple.

139
00:05:11,820 --> 00:05:14,324
那不是天花留下的疤吗
Hey, isn't that one from the smallpox?

140
00:05:14,324 --> 00:05:16,937
你当我100岁了啊 是水痘
'cause I'm 100. Chicken pox.

141
00:05:16,980 --> 00:05:18,120
是什么留下的疤不重要
And it doesn't matter where it's from.

142
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:18,940
管用就行了
It always worked.

143
00:05:19,740 --> 00:05:20,220
妈我回来了
Hey, mom.

144
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:22,460
曼尼 你怎么这么晚才从学校回来
Manny, why are you coming back from school so late?

145
00:05:22,620 --> 00:05:24,040
我被叫到校长办公室去了
I got sent to the principal's office.

146
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:26,012
我要发电子邮件骂他去
Oh. I am sending him an angry e-mail,

147
00:05:26,012 --> 00:05:27,100
因为我不知道什么时候
because I don't like when--

148
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:27,980
不不不 不是他的错
No, no, no. It's not his fault.

149
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,860
-你做错了什么事 -没有
- What did you do wrong? - Nothing.

150
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:31,560
就这样定了 我给他打电话
Oh, that's it. I'm calling him.

151
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,820
-我讨厌他故意 -不是故意的
- I hate when he tries to-- - Nothing on purpose.

152
00:05:33,820 --> 00:05:36,460
下课时 在一场大考之前
It was between periods, right before this big test.

153
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,460
我在练习吉恩·凯利的舞步
I was clearing my mind by practicing

154
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:39,940
来排除杂念
some of my Gene Kelly dance moves.

155
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:41,500
-竟然真有人那样做 -没错
- As one does. - Right.

156
00:05:41,721 --> 00:05:44,640
我的雨伞不小心勾到了火警警报
And my umbrella accidentally snagged the fire alarm.

157
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:45,980
校长以为我是故意这样做
The principal thought I did it on purpose

158
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,980
-为的是逃避考试 -但你不是
- so we'd miss the test. - But you didn't!

159
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:49,460
就这样 我要找他去
That's it! I'm going to his house!

160
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:51,300
妈 你千万别这样
Mom! You gotta stop doing this.

161
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:52,760
我不知道是不是因为怀孕
I'm not sure if it's the pregnancy,

162
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,600
当然 怀孕并不是你的错
which we both know isn't your fault...

163
00:05:56,940 --> 00:05:58,440
但最近你总是很暴脾气
But lately you've been such a hothead.

164
00:05:58,540 --> 00:06:00,920
我不是暴脾气 我是哥伦比亚人
I am not a hothead! I am Colombian.

165
00:06:01,220 --> 00:06:02,140
我们这叫兴奋
We get excited.

166
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:04,600
我们国家长满了咖啡
My country is covered in coffee.

167
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:05,720
就像那个听错了你订单的星巴克店员
Just like the Starbucks girl

168
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,680
也被你泼的满身都是咖啡吗
when she got your order wrong?

169
00:06:06,691 --> 00:06:08,880
半"咖灰" 无脂 "丝豆辣铁"
Half-caf, non-fat wet soy latte.

170
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,680
这很难听清吗
How hard is that to hear?!

171
00:06:19,867 --> 00:06:21,580
不按常规思考的人不可能
You don't get to be 2-time nonconsecutive

172
00:06:21,580 --> 00:06:24,000
两次夺得年度跨区域推销员称号的
district salesman of the year without thinking inside the box.

173
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:26,320
没错 我说的就是 按常规
That's right. I said "Inside."

174
00:06:26,616 --> 00:06:28,220
知道为什么吗 因为当每个人
You know why? 'cause while everyone's

175
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:29,940
都试图打破常规时
chasing each other around outside the box,

176
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:31,320
你知道常规是什么吗
You know what the box is?

177
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,200
常规里空无一人
Empty.

178
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:37,320
现在我们又回到了正式的用餐室
Which brings us back to our formal dining room.

179
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,680
有什么问题吗
Now any questions?

180
00:06:38,980 --> 00:06:40,640
可以给我们糖果了吗
Can we have our candy now?

181
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,840
想要糖果很简单
Just as soon as we go over

182
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:42,960
先重复一遍回去后要跟爸妈说的话
what you're gonna tell your parents.

183
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:46,436
-我们的风格是什么 -战前工匠
- Now what was our style? - Pre-war craftsman.

184
00:06:46,436 --> 00:06:48,392
好 很好 面积是多少平方英尺
Good, good. And how many square feet?

185
00:06:52,554 --> 00:06:54,240
还没有要糖的捣蛋鬼上门吗
Still no trick-or-treaters?

186
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:57,380
-还没 -可能今年大家出门晚吧
- Not yet. - Well, maybe people are going out later this year.

187
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,360
大街上全是小孩
Well, the street's full of kids,

188
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:01,800
但他们都远远地避开我们家
but they're actively detouring around our house.

189
00:07:02,361 --> 00:07:03,526
往前走
Move along.

190
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,680
谁要糖糖
Who wants some candy?

191
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,382
好多知名品牌
Plenty of name-brand...

192
00:07:14,382 --> 00:07:17,029
-家庭友善型糖糖在这里 -那是圈套
- family-friendly candy right here. - Oh! It's a trap!

193
00:07:17,029 --> 00:07:19,914
没有 我 哎呀 你呢
No. I--ooh, how about you? Hey--

194
00:07:19,914 --> 00:07:21,460
你要糖糖吗 来嘛
You want some candy, right? Come on,

195
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:22,820
-拿糖糖 -妈 妈妈 她抓住我了
- have some candy! - Mom! Mommy, she's got me!

196
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:23,940
不是 我不是故意的
No, I don't-- I'm not trying--

197
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:26,246
-我的糖 -不要了
- My candy! - Just leave it!

198
00:07:32,624 --> 00:07:35,720
杰 你得准备去米奇和小卡的派对了
Jay, you have to get ready for Mitch and Cam's party.

199
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:38,700
歌洛莉亚 你看我的皮肤是不是松了很多
Gloria, does my skin look looser to you?

200
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:39,360
什么
What?

201
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:42,020
或许我应该试试你的颈部紧致霜
Maybe I should try some of that fancy neck cream of yours.

202
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:44,560
你不是说那里面有什么钻石精华还是什么的
Don't you have some with specks of diamonds in it or something?

203
00:07:45,067 --> 00:07:46,720
不给糖就捣乱
Trick-or-treat.

204
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,300
你俩连装扮服都没穿
You guys don't even have costumes.

205
00:07:48,980 --> 00:07:49,880
我扮的是一副骨架
I'm a skeleton.

206
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,213
我扮的是一颗柠檬
And I'm--I'm a lemon.

207
00:07:51,213 --> 00:07:53,020
你们玩不给糖就捣蛋也太超龄了吧
Aren't you too old to be trick-or-treating?

208
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:54,580
你一大把年纪生孩子不也超龄了吗
Aren't you too old to be having a baby?

209
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:57,340
你觉得好笑吗 柠檬
Ah, you find that funny, lemon?

210
00:07:57,700 --> 00:07:58,900
还有更好笑的
Here's a better joke.

211
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,080
开门 开门 啥没了
Knock, knock. What's gone?

212
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:03,180
你们的糖糖
Your candy!

213
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:07,420
怎么了
What was that?

214
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:09,530
没礼貌的傻瓜 他们以为他们能...
Some rude dummies, that they think that they can--

215
00:08:09,530 --> 00:08:11,880
好了 要冷静
All right, listen. Let's just calm down.

216
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,800
准备去参加派对
Get ready for the party.

217
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:14,980
冷什么静
Calm down what?

218
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:17,360
你也和曼尼一样觉得我脾气暴躁吗
You think I'm a hothead, like Manny?

219
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:18,040
没
No!

220
00:08:18,740 --> 00:08:21,900
你有些情绪化 可能有点些易怒
You can be emotional. Volatile, maybe.

221
00:08:21,900 --> 00:08:23,620
但远远算不上...
Still, that's a far cry from--

222
00:08:23,683 --> 00:08:25,409
你们往老娘家扔鸡蛋
You put egg on my house,

223
00:08:25,409 --> 00:08:27,629
你们是不想好了
I kill what you love!

224
00:08:27,955 --> 00:08:29,502
精神病
psycho.

225
00:08:30,396 --> 00:08:32,174
-豪华储物间 -是啊 没错
- Plush utility room? - Yeah, right.

226
00:08:32,174 --> 00:08:33,900
我怎么没见着大套间
I know a hall closet when I see one.

227
00:08:33,900 --> 00:08:35,180
就像你爹从来不撒谎似的
And your dad never lies?

228
00:08:35,180 --> 00:08:36,220
你那给电器看病的老爹
What medical school

229
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:37,780
上的是什么医学院来着
did the great appliance doctor attend?

230
00:08:37,780 --> 00:08:40,361
-迪尔加多 -不 是德卡斯
-Hey, Delgado. - Oh, no! Durkas!

231
00:08:40,361 --> 00:08:41,880
只要让这把伞拥有玛丽·波平斯仙女的魔力
What I wouldn't give for this umbrella to have

232
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:42,760
我什么都愿意
Mary Poppins' powers.

233
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,640
但愿他没听见
Oh, I pray he didn't hear that.

234
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:45,900
听说你今天拉响了防火警报
Heard you pulled the fire alarm today

235
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:46,900
让我们逃掉了一场考试
and got us out of that test.

236
00:08:47,148 --> 00:08:49,260
-干的不错 -谢谢夸奖 德卡斯先生
- Good job. - Thanks, Mr. Durkas.

237
00:08:49,260 --> 00:08:51,160
知道吗 你以后不用那么称呼我了
You know what? You don't need to call me that anymore.

238
00:08:51,313 --> 00:08:53,420
还有 我们大家八点钟在操场上集会
Anyway, we're all meeting at the playground at 8:00

239
00:08:53,420 --> 00:08:54,540
然后出去玩 你想来就一起吧
And heading out, if you want to join.

240
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:56,840
你一定要去
You're totally going to that.

241
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:58,740
是嘛 那样可就毁了你好学生的美名了
Yeah, if you want to ruin your reputation.

242
00:08:58,740 --> 00:09:00,380
你总算能和那些酷小孩一起玩了
You're finally gonna be in with the cool kids.

243
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:02,280
那样你周一就得在全校大会上
You need to talk at the school assembly on Monday

244
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:03,880
向全体老师道歉
and apologize to all the teachers.

245
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:06,509
老师 更像是政府企业中的寄生虫
Teachers. More like public sector parasites.

246
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:07,400
坚强点 曼尼
Be strong, Manny.

247
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:09,660
放聪明点 冒险 派对
Be smart. Adventures, parties.

248
00:09:09,980 --> 00:09:11,040
少管所 心脏病
Juvie, heartache.

249
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:11,600
小美妞们
Girls!

250
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:13,180
但不是我们想要的那种
But not the kind we want.

251
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,500
那全都是我们想要的
They're all the kind we want.

252
00:09:14,627 --> 00:09:16,128
德拉斯先...
Mr. Dur--

253
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,080
康纳德
Conrad!

254
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,000
拿一个 我是捐蛋人[卵子捐献者]
Take one. I'm an egg donor.

255
00:09:23,144 --> 00:09:25,820
我也喜欢你的装扮 小卡 可爱的牛牛
I love your costume, too, Cam. Adora-bull.

256
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:27,760
谢谢 都是为了搞笑
Oh, well, thank you. It's all in fun.

257
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,200
我其实想穿比较紧身的装扮服
I half-wanted to wear something tighter.

258
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,520
-你懂的 我瘦了 -能看出来
- You know, I've been reducing. - I can see.

259
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:32,979
-你言不由衷啊 -没 我真看出来了
- Well, you say it like you can't. - No, no, no. I totally can.

260
00:09:35,740 --> 00:09:36,460
震撼吧
Impressive, huh?

261
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:38,814
是 我 我得...
Yeah. I'm--I'm gonna...

262
00:09:40,108 --> 00:09:41,457
-小卡 -怎么
- Hey, Cam. - Mm?

263
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:43,540
我听说你在我们的客人面前脱衣服
I'm hearing a rumor that you keep flashing our guests.

264
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,260
不是变态的啦
Oh, well, not in a perverted way.

265
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:46,840
我只是希望让大家看看我隐藏在
I just want people to see my body

266
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,160
这套烂装扮服下的苗条身材
under this stupid costume.

267
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:50,260
这理由跟真正露阴癖的说辞差不多
That's very close to what actual flashers say.

268
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:51,900
-爸爸 -等一下 宝贝
- Daddy? - Yeah, one second, honey.

269
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:53,180
我已经厌倦了不断赞美他人
I'm just tired of throwing out compliments

270
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:54,100
却一句好话也听不到
and not getting anything back.

271
00:09:54,110 --> 00:09:55,859
我跟罗伯托说他的美黑做得很自然
I told Roberto his spray tan looked real.

272
00:09:55,859 --> 00:09:58,424
你自己看 把我们家枕头和猫都染黑了
Look for yourself. It's on two of our pillows and our cat.

273
00:09:58,424 --> 00:09:59,875
爹地 怎么了
Daddy. Yeah?

274
00:09:59,875 --> 00:10:02,460
看 那是我妈咪 她来了
Lookit. It's my mommy. She came.

275
00:10:02,460 --> 00:10:04,560
不 宝贝 那不是你妈咪
Oh. Oh, no, honey, that's not your mommy.

276
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,600
不是吗
It's not?

277
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,360
不是的 那只是爸爸的一个朋友
No, no. That's just one of daddy's friends.

278
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:09,020
-什么情况 -没什么
- What's going on? - Oh, nothing.

279
00:10:09,020 --> 00:10:10,180
她只是想吃蛋糕了
She just wants one of these cupcakes.

280
00:10:10,180 --> 00:10:11,907
-但我已经吃过... -给你吃 宝贝
- But I already had... - Oh, there you go, honey.

281
00:10:11,907 --> 00:10:14,061
好了 去吧 去交朋友 交起来
Okay, off you go. Mingle! Mingle!

282
00:10:17,660 --> 00:10:19,280
看来有人来过了
Looks like some people came by.

283
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:20,820
是的 没错 有好几个人呢
Yeah. Oh, yeah, we had a few.

284
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:21,820
我看到你给踢下去了
I saw that.

285
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:24,760
你好
Hello?

286
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:25,840
嘿 亲爱的
Hey, honey.

287
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:28,360
你的开放参观搞得怎样
Hi. How's your open house?

288
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,880
没什么人来 其实
Pretty empty, actually.

289
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,200
我把气撒在一个
I kind of just took it out

290
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:32,980
扮成哈利·波特的孩子身上了
on a Harry Potter.

291
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:34,920
不过说真的 格兰芬多的学生
Seriously, though, a Gryffindor

292
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:36,580
怎么会让他妈帮他拿魁地奇飞天扫帚
letting his mom carry his Quidditch broom?

293
00:10:36,620 --> 00:10:37,860
那有多赫奇帕奇作风啊
How Hufflepuff is that?

294
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,200
我这里也很凄凉
It's pretty lonely here, too.

295
00:10:39,375 --> 00:10:41,440
我们被所有邻居列入黑名单了
We have been shunned by the whole neighborhood.

296
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,320
太荒谬了
That's ridiculous.

297
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:44,540
就因为你那个温柔的小把戏吗
All over some mild little gag you pulled?

298
00:10:45,192 --> 00:10:48,310
那并不温柔 都有人来调查...
It was not mild. There was an investig...

299
00:10:50,195 --> 00:10:51,800
我想我听到有人进来
Oh, I-I thought I heard someone.

300
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:54,360
可能只是树枝敲得窗户响
I guess it was just trees tapping against the window.

301
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,780
在这陈旧得格格直响的房子里真恐怖
It's pretty creepy over here in this rattly old house.

302
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:01,180
总之 我可能再呆半小时
Anyway, I'll probably give it another 30 minutes,

303
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:01,960
然后就回去了
then I'll see you at home.

304
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,060
好的 再见
Okay. Bye.

305
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,800
你笑什么呢
What are you laughing about?

306
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:08,600
笑你可怜的老爸 你懂的
Oh, it's just your poor dad, you know.

307
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,320
你可怜的傻老爸
Your poor, dumb dad.

308
00:11:20,260 --> 00:11:21,780
我明天员工大会上再告诉你
I'll fill you in at the staff meeting

309
00:11:21,780 --> 00:11:24,500
不过先得等克莱利说完他早晨上班路上的事
after Keneally's done telling us about his morning commute.

310
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,860
太逗了 你学他学得真像
That's hilarious! You sound just like him.

311
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:30,466
圣诞才艺表演时你一定得来一段
You are so doing that at Christmas talent night.

312
00:11:30,466 --> 00:11:33,110
哥们 《千金小姐》 《莎拉的微笑》
Dude, "Rich Girl", "Sara Smile"...

313
00:11:33,110 --> 00:11:35,264
以及返场的《少男杀手》
then a "Maneater" Encore.

314
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:37,380
他们简直棒得可怕
It was scary how good they were.

315
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,460
闭上眼睛听 跟真的乐队演唱一样
Close your eyes, it could have been the real band.

316
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:42,260
他赌球时走运了那么一次
Yeah, he got lucky in the football pool once,

317
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:43,780
现在就要加倍下赌注了
and now he wants to double the stakes.

318
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,460
我好怕怕
Oh, I'm so scared!

319
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:47,480
有没有
Right?

320
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:50,460
今晚弱爆了
Well, this night was a bust.

321
00:11:51,060 --> 00:11:52,820
一个人都没有...
not a single person even...

322
00:11:54,780 --> 00:11:56,660
还是我过早断言了
Or did I speak too soon?

323
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:59,900
有人想扮坏小艳鬼了吗
Was someone in the mood to be a bad little ghoul?

324
00:12:01,340 --> 00:12:03,460
康尼 我不是说你
Oh, Connie, I didn't mean you.

325
00:12:03,525 --> 00:12:07,127
我 那 那只是离婚的事影响了你
I'm...hey, that's just...that's just the divorce talking.

326
00:12:07,740 --> 00:12:08,600
坚持住
Hang in there.

327
00:12:08,744 --> 00:12:09,869
再见
Bye-bye.

328
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:20,080
看来某人终于决定变装成
Well, someone decided to take a trip

329
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,380
《梦幻岛》里的人物了
to Fantasy Island after all.

330
00:12:21,420 --> 00:12:23,140
我好讨厌人们注意不到我全新曼妙的体形
Well, I'm tired of people not noticing my new physique.

331
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,620
要是这还不成 我就穿上尿布
If this doesn't work, I'm breaking out the diaper

332
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:26,200
戴上大礼帽扮作新年宝宝 你好
and top hat and going as Baby New Year! Hello.

333
00:12:26,380 --> 00:12:27,960
天呐
Oh, my god!

334
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:30,660
囧囧 是你吗
John-John, is that you?

335
00:12:30,660 --> 00:12:32,920
-你看起来太棒了 -谢谢
- You look amazing. - Thanks!

336
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:35,000
减掉一百磅 身材自然棒
That's what happens when you lose 100 pounds.

337
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,399
靠 他个小贱...
Oh, come on. What a...

338
00:12:36,399 --> 00:12:37,706
-谁想举我 -我
- Who wants to lift me? - Me.

339
00:12:37,706 --> 00:12:40,240
拜托 他怎么能不打电话就过来呢
Come on. How could he have not called us?

340
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:42,020
天呐 他轻得像羽毛一样
Oh, my god, he's as light as a feather.

341
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,880
你猜怎么着 我要去举举他
You know what? I'm gonna go lift him

342
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,540
然后晃到他手术钉都爆出来[缩胃手术]
and shake him till his staples pop.

343
00:12:45,540 --> 00:12:46,220
小卡 别这样
Cam, stop!

344
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:48,401
我只是说我们原本可以抓住那两个小子
Just saying that we could have caught those kids.

345
00:12:48,401 --> 00:12:50,280
怎么着 要追着他们跑一晚上吗
What, and chase them around all night?

346
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:51,680
我不是个年轻小伙子了
I'm not a young man anymore,

347
00:12:51,700 --> 00:12:53,280
世人都不断提醒我那一点
as the world keeps pointing out.

348
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:55,120
刚刚外面那个服务生叫你什么
What did that waiter just call you outside?

349
00:12:55,340 --> 00:12:56,180
中世纪的科尼尔
Medieval Knievel.

350
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:58,120
好好笑哦
That is hilarious.

351
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:00,140
我喜欢人们在装扮上花心思
I love when people put some thought into their outfit.

352
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:01,960
你是非法外星人 我是甜爹
Illegal Alien, Sugar Daddy.

353
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:03,080
你为什么说"非法"
Why do you say "illegal"?

354
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:05,260
因为戴着天线代表外星人 而你是...
Because antennas are alien, and you're...

355
00:13:05,260 --> 00:13:06,300
怎样 非法移民吗
What? Illegal?

356
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,320
就因为我的肤色吗
Because of the color of my skin?

357
00:13:08,700 --> 00:13:11,600
我干脆把你的宝宝扔进这煤气罐里吧
Why don't I dump your baby in your gas tank?

358
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:13,480
歌洛莉亚 别这样 请别介意
Gloria! Uh, no hard feelings, please.

359
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,760
尽情享受你的派对 好吗
Just enjoy the party, okay?

360
00:13:15,913 --> 00:13:17,880
首先 放轻松 我们在派对上呢
First of all, relax. We're at a party.

361
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:19,820
其次 你已经被驱逐出境两次
Secondly, you've been deported twice.

362
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,840
你不能再这么敏感了
You're not allowed to be that defensive.

363
00:13:21,958 --> 00:13:24,086
我最近是怎么了
What is it with me lately?

364
00:13:24,086 --> 00:13:26,320
曼尼是对的 我真是个暴脾气
Manny's right. I'm such a hothead.

365
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,740
这是难免的 你怀孕了
It happens. You're pregnant.

366
00:13:28,740 --> 00:13:30,400
就是这个原因 对吗
That's what it is, isn't it?

367
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:34,200
因为这个宝宝 他在里面生闷气
It's the baby. It's angry in there.

368
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,520
-不是的 -就是
- No! - Yes!

369
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:38,520
你刚刚自己说的 我变了
You just said it yourself. I have changed.

370
00:13:38,920 --> 00:13:41,840
我肚子里有个愤怒的娃 逼着我干坏事
I have an angry baby inside of me making me do bad things!

371
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:43,280
荷尔蒙而已
It's just hormones.

372
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:45,360
是你的熊妈妈本能在发作
It's your mama bear instinct kicking in.

373
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,520
不是什么坏事
And that's a good thing,

374
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:49,480
因为这说明你会是一个好母亲 第二次
because that means you're gonna be a great mom--again.

375
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:52,520
你真这么想
Do you really think so?

376
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:53,780
你肚里的娃真幸运
You got a lucky little kid in there.

377
00:13:53,940 --> 00:13:56,860
他的妈妈可不会让任何人伤害他
He's got a mom who's not gonna let anyone harm him.

378
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,040
或她
Or her.

379
00:13:58,950 --> 00:14:00,173
希望是儿子
Or--or him.

380
00:14:00,173 --> 00:14:01,659
不给糖果就捣蛋
Trick-or-treat.

381
00:14:06,420 --> 00:14:07,380
去吧
Go ahead.

382
00:14:07,597 --> 00:14:09,114
你们最好跑快点
You better run!

383
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:12,740
我的天呐
Oh, my gosh,

384
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:14,560
看看多萌啊
Is that the most precious thing you've ever seen?

385
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:15,380
我的天
Oh, my god.

386
00:14:16,206 --> 00:14:18,595
你还认识其他公主吗
Do you know other princesses?

387
00:14:18,595 --> 00:14:20,180
相信我 我认识一大堆呢
Trust me. I know lots.

388
00:14:20,180 --> 00:14:21,140
好了 该睡觉了
Okay. Bedtime.

389
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:22,440
别 没那么晚
Oh, no, it's not that late.

390
00:14:22,620 --> 00:14:24,940
你认识我妈妈吗 她就是个公主
Do you know my mom? She's a princess.

391
00:14:25,260 --> 00:14:26,120
她累坏了
She's exhausted.

392
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:27,980
说胡话呢 她太累了
She's not making sense. She's so tired.

393
00:14:27,980 --> 00:14:29,740
爸爸 是你跟我说的
Daddy, you told me!

394
00:14:29,980 --> 00:14:31,060
她说什么呢 米奇尔
What is she talking about, Mitchell?

395
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:33,300
我的亲身母亲 她是公主 对吧
My real mom. She is, right?

396
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:35,380
好了 我想我们需要谈谈
Okay, I think we need to have a little talk.

397
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:38,400
萨姆 注意到小卡变苗条了没
Sam, do you notice how slim Cam's getting?

398
00:14:38,460 --> 00:14:40,400
少来 等我回来再听你的回答
Nice try. I will be back for that answer.

399
00:14:44,694 --> 00:14:46,296
没用的 克莱尔
This isn't gonna work, Claire...

400
00:14:47,226 --> 00:14:48,588
我知道你在这儿
'cause I know you're here.

401
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:52,180
打算怎么吓我呀
What's the plan, anyway?

402
00:14:52,705 --> 00:14:54,458
冷不丁蹦出来吗
You gonna pop out at me?

403
00:14:54,882 --> 00:14:56,635
要想吓到我这还差得远
It's gonna take more than that to scare this--

404
00:14:56,635 --> 00:14:58,455
-有人吗 -嗨
- Hello?! - Hi!

405
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,800
还能看房吗
Is the house still open?

406
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:02,580
能 是的 我马上下来
Oh, yes! Yes! I'll be right down.

407
00:15:02,780 --> 00:15:04,160
克莱尔 别闹了 我有工作
Claire, this is serious! I have a job!

408
00:15:04,588 --> 00:15:06,587
并不是说你没工作 你全年无休
Not that you don't. You work 24/7

409
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:08,200
得到的回报远少于付出的
and you don't get half the appreciation you deserve.

410
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:09,300
但我们能过会再说不
Can we talk about this later?

411
00:15:09,940 --> 00:15:12,300
如你们潜在买家所见
As you potential buyers can see,

412
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:14,520
这是 一座漂亮的房子
This is a, uh, a beautiful home.

413
00:15:14,520 --> 00:15:15,240
这后面是什么
What's behind here?

414
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:16,900
是我就不过去
Oh, I wouldn't go in there!

415
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:19,920
除非你们喜欢正式餐厅
Unless you love formal dining rooms.

416
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:23,280
-亲爱的 瞧瞧这个 -在厨房呢
- Honey, look at this. - I'm in the kitchen.

417
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:25,140
我们最好呆在一起
Oh, we should probably stay together.

418
00:15:25,920 --> 00:15:26,300
赶紧的 希拉
Come on, Sheila.

419
00:15:27,180 --> 00:15:28,980
-菲尔 问个问题 这些是 -等等
- Phil, one question. Are these-- - Wait, wait.

420
00:15:28,980 --> 00:15:30,680
我超爱看人们的反应
I just love to see people's reactions

421
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:31,660
当我向他们展示
When I show them--

422
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:34,020
如此大的存储空间 靠 太疯狂了
So much storage. What? It's crazy!

423
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,720
我想你们会发现这所房子
I think you guys will find that this house

424
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:39,380
惊喜重重
is full of so many... delightful surprises

425
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,500
你们会很高兴...
That you'll be happy here for--

426
00:15:41,500 --> 00:15:43,060
-我的天呐 -那人我不认识
- Oh, my god! - I don't know her!

427
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:44,800
这是原装浴缸吗
Is this the original tub?

428
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,080
什么 是的
What? Yes, it is.

429
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,742
它是 原装浴缸
It is, uh, the original tub.

430
00:15:48,742 --> 00:15:51,048
原始夹具 斜面镜
Um, original fixtures, beveled mirror,

431
00:15:51,048 --> 00:15:52,760
有个宽敞的淋浴隔间就足够了
Just a-a huge stall shower.

432
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:54,840
如果你们将 想搞个派对的话
If you guys would, uh, want to have a party.

433
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:55,720
我开玩笑呢
I'm kidding, of course.

434
00:15:55,730 --> 00:15:59,308
这是座 个性鲜明的房子
But, um, just a house with a real personality.

435
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:03,660
我们马上就来 甜心
We'll be right in, sweetie.

436
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:06,580
我们说好要一起告诉莉莉她娘的事
We agreed to tell Lily about her mother together,

437
00:16:06,580 --> 00:16:07,700
一起穿着大地色有镇静作用的衣服
wearing calming earth tones,

438
00:16:07,700 --> 00:16:09,460
而且我们说好要告诉她真相的
and we agreed to tell her the truth.

439
00:16:09,620 --> 00:16:11,660
我知道 但难道你就从没向莉莉说过
I know, but haven't you ever said something dumb to Lily

440
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:12,980
任何希望她转眼忘掉的蠢话
that you wish she would just forget?

441
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,380
别扯上我 赶紧解决这事吧
This isn't about me. Let's just fix this.

442
00:16:15,380 --> 00:16:16,860
好的 挺好 但是...
Okay, great. Although...

443
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:19,600
你答应得如此爽快让我不得不怀疑
the way you agreed so quickly makes me wonder

444
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,780
你又对莉莉说过些什么
what sort of things you've told her.

445
00:16:20,780 --> 00:16:23,051
我可能告诉过她说谎会害死小鸟
I may have told her her fibs kills birds.

446
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:25,260
你真行 等下再来谈这事
Wow. We're coming back to that one.

447
00:16:26,814 --> 00:16:28,320
嗨 公主
Oh, hi, princess.

448
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:30,240
乖女儿 能说个小话不
Hey, Lil. Could we talk to you for a second?

449
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,740
我闯祸了吗
Am I in trouble?

450
00:16:32,020 --> 00:16:34,280
我的天 没有 当然不是 甜心
Oh, gosh, no. Of course not, sweetie.

451
00:16:34,669 --> 00:16:37,680
你还记得我们过去老跟你说
Um... Well, do you remember how we used to tell you

452
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:39,440
枯萎的花会到达天堂的事吗
there was a heaven for all the flowers that die?

453
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:40,880
"过去老说"是神马意思
What do you mean, "used to"?

454
00:16:40,940 --> 00:16:42,560
抱歉 说漏嘴鸟 过会儿再谈
Sorry, I let it slip. We'll deal with it later.

455
00:16:42,572 --> 00:16:44,300
乃到底瞒着我多少事
Much much are you not telling me?

456
00:16:44,300 --> 00:16:46,220
乃们为什么这么说话
Why are you talking like this?

457
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:47,263
爸爸们刚说岔了
Daddies took a little side trip.

458
00:16:47,263 --> 00:16:50,360
-不好意思 甜心 -有时候
- Sorry, sweetie. - Um, so sometimes, uh,

459
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,820
我们说一些话只是想让你高兴
we tell you things like that to make you feel better.

460
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:56,200
当我告诉你你妈妈是公主时
And I might have done the same thing

461
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:58,300
也只是想让你高兴
when I told you that your mom is a princess.

462
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,920
那她不是公主
So she's not?

463
00:17:02,980 --> 00:17:04,320
你知道吗
Well, you know what?

464
00:17:04,500 --> 00:17:06,000
-她可能是 -可能是的
- She might be. - She might be.

465
00:17:06,100 --> 00:17:08,320
但我们不能肯定 宝贝
But we can't know for sure, honey,

466
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,920
因为 我们不知道她在哪里
Because... well, we don't know where she is

467
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,980
或是 她在做什么
Or... what she's doing.

468
00:17:13,993 --> 00:17:15,840
但我们知道的是
B-but what--what we do know

469
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:17,620
她非常非常爱你
is that she loved you very, very much...

470
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:19,500
她知道自己没法好好照顾你
And she knew that she couldn't take care of you,

471
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:21,540
所以她让你来到了
so she made sure that you went

472
00:17:21,540 --> 00:17:23,900
她能找到的最有爱的家庭
with the most loving family she could find.

473
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:27,620
所以我们三个人组成了一个家
And that's how the three of us became a family.

474
00:17:27,620 --> 00:17:28,660
这样说你能接受吗 亲爱的
Does that make sense, sweetie?

475
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,760
你有问题要问我们吗
Do you have any questions for us?

476
00:17:32,100 --> 00:17:34,920
你们为什么要说谎 害死一只鸟
Why did you say a fib and kill a bird?

477
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:40,200
我刚才注意到你和你太太一起来的
I noticed you walking in with your wife earlier.

478
00:17:40,300 --> 00:17:41,040
她好漂亮
She's stunning.

479
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:42,820
知道你这句恭维话里我最喜欢什么吗
You know my favorite part of that compliment?

480
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:43,880
你认为她是我太太
You knew she was my wife.

481
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,460
全世界一半的人认为她是我女儿
Half the world thinks she's my daughter.

482
00:17:45,600 --> 00:17:47,800
要我说 幸运的是她
Well, if you ask me, she's a lucky girl.

483
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:49,220
对我来说就不幸了
Bummer for me, though.

484
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:51,540
大帅哥在这里 却已经名草有主了
Handsomest man in here, and he's taken.

485
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:53,240
我敢肯定你的追求者不少
I'll bet you do all right with the boys.

486
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:55,340
的确
I do.

487
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:57,580
而我感兴趣的是你
It's the men I'm interested in.

488
00:17:57,840 --> 00:17:59,340
看来你是个直抒胸臆的人啊
You just put it all right out there, don't you?

489
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:01,740
我倒是想约束一下我的"凶器"[男根]
I always try to hold a little something back.

490
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:04,620
我的天
Oh, my gosh.

491
00:18:04,620 --> 00:18:06,460
别过去 别管他们
No, no, no, no, no, no. Leave him.

492
00:18:06,460 --> 00:18:08,620
-可你知道这是... -知道 他需要这个
- No, but you know that's a-- - I know. He needs this.

493
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:09,480
好吧
Okay.

494
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:11,520
-很高兴认识你 杰 -我也是 萨姆
- It was great meeting you, Jay. - You, too, Sam.

495
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:14,400
哇 看来某人很喜欢你啊
Wow! Looks like somebody really likes you.

496
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:15,900
我能说什么呢 魅力不减当年啊
What can I say? I still got it.

497
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,960
我一直想问你 你瘦身了吗
I've been meaning to ask you-- have you lost some weight?

498
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:20,460
-你看起来棒极了 -你不知道
- Because you look good. - Wow, you have no idea

499
00:18:20,460 --> 00:18:21,960
你这句话对我来说多重要 杰
what that means to hear from you, Jay.

500
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:23,426
抱那边
Uh, turn it that way.

501
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:25,160
我觉得这样会让你开心起来
I thought this might cheer you up.

502
00:18:25,372 --> 00:18:27,611
灰机 灰机
Da plane! Da plane!

503
00:18:27,760 --> 00:18:28,620
宝贝女儿
Baby girl!

504
00:18:29,560 --> 00:18:31,880
瞧你 连经典词都教给她了
Look you! You even taught her the catchphrase.

505
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:34,170
杰 来见见我的新"纹身"
Yeah. Jay, have you seen my new tattoo?

506
00:18:34,170 --> 00:18:35,660
-再联系 -多谢前来
- Be in touch. - Well, thanks so much for coming.

507
00:18:35,660 --> 00:18:37,240
-多谢 -客气了
- Yeah. Thanks. - Okay.

508
00:18:41,940 --> 00:18:44,800
克莱尔 他们走了 你可以出来了
Okay, Claire, they're gone. You can come out now.

509
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:47,160
克莱尔
Claire?

510
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:50,720
亲爱的 很抱歉我之前说你不吓人
Honey, I'm sorry I said you weren't scary.

511
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:52,420
今天太累了
It's been such a long day.

512
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:53,900
我们回家好吗
Can we please just go home?

513
00:19:00,330 --> 00:19:03,238
好了 我自己走咯
All right. I'm leaving without ya.

514
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:23,880
看来 你会用这个遥控器啊
So... this remote you know how to use.

515
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:40,480
喂
Yes?

516
00:19:41,100 --> 00:19:41,920
菲尔 你在哪里
Phil, where are you?

517
00:19:42,420 --> 00:19:44,140
克莱尔 你在哪里
Claire? Where are you?

518
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:46,820
我过去吓你 但听到你带那对夫妻
I came over to scare you, but then I heard you

519
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:48,120
参观房子
showing the house to that couple,

520
00:19:48,120 --> 00:19:49,240
所以我就没妨碍你
so I got out of your way.

521
00:19:50,514 --> 00:19:51,640
你在家里吗
Are you at home?

522
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:53,420
是 我十分钟前就回来了
Yeah. I got here ten minutes ago.

523
00:19:53,498 --> 00:19:56,221
那 那你是说
S-so... So you're saying...

524
00:19:56,760 --> 00:19:59,860
这通电话不是从这间房子里打来的
This call isn't coming from inside the house?

525
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:02,000
你说什么呢 快回家吧
What are you talking about? Just get home.

526
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:02,980
孩子们和我都饿了
The kids and I are hungry.

527
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:04,540
快点 爸
Yeah, hurry up, dad.

528
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:05,728
我们想你
We miss you!

529
00:20:07,220 --> 00:20:08,660
我也想你 小老弟
Miss you, too, buddy.

530
00:20:43,957 --> 00:20:45,447
不给糖就捣蛋
Trick-or-treat!

531
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:52,820
其实我也没那么害怕啦
I wasn't really that scared.

532
00:20:56,740 --> 00:20:56,900
好吧怕死了
Okay.

533
00:21:01,840 --> 00:21:04,340
你还没说你有没有用蛋砸到那些小子
Hey, you never told me if you hit those kids with that egg.

534
