but there was a slow one with them.

536
00:21:07,820 --> 00:21:08,920
他跑不快
He couldn't run so fast,

537
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:10,460
所以我好好地用蛋给他洗了下
and I nailed him pretty good.

538
00:21:10,838 --> 00:21:13,227
-我警告过你的 -好啦 罗本
- I warned you. - Okay, Reuben.

539
00:21:13,227 --> 00:21:14,851
你那些酷朋友现在去哪里了
Where are your cool friends now?

540
00:21:14,861 --> 00:21:16,852
没用棉签替你清洗耳朵 这是肯定的
Not q-tipping your ear, that's for sure.

541
00:21:16,852 --> 00:21:18,608
得了 罗本
Okay, Reuben.

542
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:20,680
这就是我不和酷孩子混在一起的原因
This is why I never hang out with cool kids.

543
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:22,280
是啊 是你拒绝了他们
Yeah, you rejected them,

544
00:21:22,280 --> 00:21:23,660
就在你和你妈在达人秀上
Shortly after you and your mom

545
00:21:23,660 --> 00:21:25,244
表演滚轴溜冰舞之后
roller danced at the talent show.

546
00:21:25,244 --> 00:21:26,500
我家被烧了缺钱
Oh... we were robbed.

547
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:27,800
反正跟你们选的歌一点关系都没有
Couldn't have been the song you picked.

548
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:29,510
《翼下之风》 痛
"Wind beneath my w--" Ow!
